<% const enrollment=it.enrollment || {mode:'email',version:0,emails:[]}; const draft=it.enrollmentDraft; %>
<section class="school-settings-card" id="school-enrollment" aria-labelledby="school-enrollment-title">
 <header><span class="school-settings-step" aria-hidden="true"><svg class="workspace-svg"><use href="#ws-users"/></svg></span><div><h2 id="school-enrollment-title">Student enrollment</h2><p>Choose whether students need a place on your approved enrollment roster.</p></div></header>
 <div class="school-settings-card-body">
  <% if(it.enrollmentNotice) { %><p class="school-settings-feedback" role="status"><%= it.enrollmentNotice %></p><% } %>
  <div class="enrollment-summary"><div><span>Current access rule</span><strong><%= enrollment.mode==='roster'?'Enrollment roster required':'School email or invitation' %></strong></div><div><span>Saved roster</span><strong><%= enrollment.emails.length %> email<%= enrollment.emails.length===1?'':'s' %> · version <%= enrollment.version %></strong></div></div>
  <p>School email matching still requires a verified domain and a confirmed account email. Personal emails can use invitations, access requests or instant joining from the approved email list. Staff roles are always managed by administrators.</p>
  <a class="platform-text-link" href="<%= (it.invitationAction || '').replace(/invitations$/,'student-access') %>">Manage student joining & requests →</a>
  <form method="post" action="<%= it.enrollmentAction %>" class="care-form enrollment-form">
   <input type="hidden" name="version" value="<%= draft?draft.version:enrollment.version %>" />
   <label for="enrollment-mode">Student access rule</label><select class="workspace-input" id="enrollment-mode" name="mode" aria-describedby="enrollment-rule-help"><option value="email" <%= (draft?.mode || enrollment.mode)==='email'?'selected':'' %>>School email or invitation — no roster check</option><option value="roster" <%= (draft?.mode || enrollment.mode)==='roster'?'selected':'' %>>Require a match on the enrollment roster</option></select>
   <p class="staff-footnote" id="enrollment-rule-help">Roster mode applies to all student memberships, including invited students. It does not affect administrators or moderators.</p>
   <label for="enrollment-file">Import an email list</label><input type="file" id="enrollment-file" accept=".csv,.txt,text/csv,text/plain" data-enrollment-import/><p data-enrollment-import-status role="status">Upload a one-column CSV or text file, or paste emails below. Importing does not save changes.</p>
   <label for="enrollment-emails">Complete approved email roster</label><textarea class="workspace-input" id="enrollment-emails" name="emails" rows="8" maxlength="260000" spellcheck="false" autocapitalize="none" aria-describedby="enrollment-roster-help enrollment-impact" placeholder="student1@my.cspc.edu.ph&#10;student2@my.cspc.edu.ph"><%= draft?draft.text:enrollment.emails.join('\n') %></textarea>
   <p class="staff-footnote" id="enrollment-roster-help">Paste the email column from your enrollment list, one address per line. Up to 1,000 unique emails. A CSV may have an Email heading. Do not include names, student IDs or other columns. Duplicates and capitalization are normalized.</p>
   <div class="enrollment-impact" id="enrollment-impact"><strong>This replaces the entire saved roster.</strong><p>When roster mode is enabled, students missing from this list have their school access paused. An empty list pauses all students. Accounts and submitted ideas stay saved. Adding a student's verified email back restores eligibility unless their membership was revoked.</p></div>
   <label class="enrollment-confirm"><input type="checkbox" name="reviewed" value="yes" required /><span>I reviewed the complete roster and understand how this rule affects student access.</span></label>
   <button class="school-settings-primary" type="submit">Save enrollment settings</button>
  </form>
 </div>
</section>
